g health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate.\n- **Rollback:** I picked v2.3.0 because it's the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1-rc came later but was only ever healthy in staging, so I didn't use it.\n- **Result:** all three regions are on v2.3.0, and the error rate is down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident INC-0001:** it describes the failure, the rollback and the current status. It also notes that someone needs to find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before anyone redeploys it.", "type": "text"}]}]}